<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 11.35 bln levs of 4-wk T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 11.35 bln levs of 4-wk T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed a special issue of four-week discount T-bills, yielding 17.61 percent to maturity, the central bank said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the central bank did not say to which financial institution or institutions the issue was placed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow.:</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3015497004</p>
<p> Term			    four weeks</p>
<p> Auction date		  February 12, 1997</p>
<p> Issue date		    February 12, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date		 March 12, 1997</p>
<p> Par value		     11,354 million levs</p>
<p> Accepted price		85.03 pct</p>
<p> Avg yield to maturity     17.61 pct @</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
